  - The revised proposed date is August 27.
  - The party is at dusk.
  - The party is in a park.
  - The location should be away from a lake.
  - The food is an egg-free picnic.
  - The food should contain no blue cheese.
  - The gift is a heist film.
  - Lavender is an additional gift or decoration.
